<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani cotton yarn rates close unchanged.</title>
<headline>Pakistani cotton yarn rates close unchanged.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistani cotton yarn rates closed unchanged on Wednesday because of low demand from yarn-users and less buying orders from abroad, and are likely to remain stable in the next few days.</p>
<p>Following are the rates in rupees supplied by the Pakistan Yarn Merchants Association for 10-lb (4.54 kg) cone of 21 counts:			    Wednesday   Jan 5</p>
<p>    Al-Karam		     510	   510</p>
<p>    Taj Textile		  510	   510</p>
<p>    Suraiya Textile	    500	   500</p>
<p>($1 = 40.22 rupees) -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
